BT /F1 11 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 662 Tm (ISO/IEC 27001:2022 specifies requirements for an information security management system \(ISMS\). An) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 647.26 Tm (organisation determines its context, risks, responsibilities and measures, and monitors their operation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 632.52 Tm (Annex A provides reference controls for risk treatment. It is not a list of automatically mandatory firewall) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 617.78 Tm (settings. Assessing one control does not demonstrate fulfilment of all ISMS requirements.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.3 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 593.04 Tm (Clause 6.1.3: risk treatment) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 571.04 Tm (A risk is first identified and assessed. The organisation then selects a suitable treatment and determines) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 0.09 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 42 556.3 Tm (the controls required. The selected controls are compared with Annex A so that relevant measures are) Tj ET
